Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.02,Hook,,0,0,0,,BUSCANDO VICE CITY EN\NGTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Dónde está la mansión que\Nbusco?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No puede ser que no exista\Nla mansión de Ricardo\NDíaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me parte el corazón que no\Nesté, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Me parte el corazón!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ay, me lo parte!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ok, el hotel Ocean View\Ntiene que estar sí o sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:17.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Yo sabía que estaba el\Nsitio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Esto es durísimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Vamos a ver
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}qué pasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Pero, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:27.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡La playa, amigo!
